                <button type="button" data-trailer-debug-export-defaults aria-label="Copy trailer tuning defaults" data-tooltip-title="Copy code defaults" data-tooltip-body="Copy JavaScript constants you can paste back into the source code.">COPY DEFAULTS</button>
